<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT CALIFORNIA WEST TOURNAMENT.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, California 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the</p>
<p>Bank of the West Classic women's tennis tournament Thursday:</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>2-Monica Seles (U.S.) beat Rita Grande (Italy) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>6-Conchita Martinez (Spain) beat Amy Frazier (U.S.) 6-1 6-1</p>
<p>7-Kim Po (U.S.) beat Ai Sugiyama (Japan) 6-3 6-1</p>
<p>Linda Wild (U.S.) beat Anne Kremer (Luxembourg) 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
